source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Only exactly `{X}` is the brace form, so `{**}` leaves two bare delimiters and the second of each pair carries the effect.
-- input.jira --
a{**}b{**}c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a{*<b>}b{</b>*}c</p>
-- want.md --
a{\***}b{**\*}c
-- warnings.json --
[]
